<title>USA: Progressive Angioplasty IPO withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Progressive Angioplasty IPO withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Progressive Angioplasty Systems Inc's initial public offering has been withdrawn, said underwriter UBS Securities.</p>
<p>On February 4, U.S. Surgical Corp said it acquired an exclusive option to buy all of the outstanding shares of Progressive Angioplasty.</p>
<p>Progressive Angioplasty was offering 5.0 million shares at a price range of $12 to $14.</p>
